## Why This Is Asked
Tests for offline-first applications with service workers and cross-tab interactions are common in modern web development. This question evaluates practical E2E thinking around offline caching, network replay, idempotent API design, and conflict resolution at a beginner level.

## Key Concepts
- Offline-first UX and service workers
